1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:00,980
At 52,

2
00:00:00,980 --> 00:00:02,241
she wasn't afraid

3
00:00:02,241 --> 00:00:03,502
of being alone.

4
00:00:04,002 --> 00:00:04,859
She was afraid

5
00:00:04,859 --> 00:00:06,145
of choosing wrong again.

6
00:00:06,695 --> 00:00:08,646
After a painful relationship,

7
00:00:08,646 --> 00:00:10,380
even a kind invitation

8
00:00:10,380 --> 00:00:11,030
felt risky.

9
00:00:11,650 --> 00:00:13,726
When someone asked her to dinner,

10
00:00:13,726 --> 00:00:14,879
she nearly said no.

11
00:00:15,949 --> 00:00:17,942
Not because she didn't want love,

12
00:00:17,942 --> 00:00:20,220
but because she remembered

13
00:00:20,220 --> 00:00:20,790
the cost.

14
00:00:21,440 --> 00:00:22,778
Then she asked herself:

15
00:00:23,378 --> 00:00:25,257
“What if protecting my heart

16
00:00:25,257 --> 00:00:27,404
means never giving it a chance?”

17
00:00:28,384 --> 00:00:30,215
She didn't promise herself

18
00:00:30,215 --> 00:00:31,741
a happy ending.

19
00:00:31,741 --> 00:00:33,877
She said yes to one coffee.

20
00:00:34,527 --> 00:00:36,026
Because starting over

21
00:00:36,026 --> 00:00:37,775
doesn't mean trusting everyone.

22
00:00:38,125 --> 00:00:40,016
It means learning from the past,

23
00:00:40,016 --> 00:00:41,637
without letting it choose

24
00:00:41,637 --> 00:00:42,447
your future.
